Package: sokar-message-transport-matrix
Version: [[deb.version]]
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Michael Schnell <michael@fuin.org>
Depends: sokar, sokar-message-sluice-filter, libc6 (>= [[matrix.glibc.floor]]), zlib1g (>= 1:[[matrix.zlib.floor]])
Provides: sokar-transport
Homepage: https://github.com/sokar-ai/sokar-message-matrix
Description: The Matrix transport for Sokar
 Carries messages Sokar's filter let through into a project's Matrix room,
 and brings the room's messages back into a task's mailbox. Sokar finds it
 by scanning /usr/libexec/sokar/transports/ and drives it over files.
